      "text": [
        " \"لَوْ بَقِيَ كَانَ عَلَى مِنْهَاجِ أَبِيهِ صَلَوَاتُ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4735 - Jameel ibn Darraj asked Abu Abdullah (as) about Ibrahim, the son of the Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace and blessings be upon him and his family), whether he would have been a truthful prophet (ṣiddiq nabi) if he had lived.\nImam (as) replied: \"If he had lived, he would have followed the path of his father (peace and blessings be upon him).\""
        ]
      }
